# Go build artifacts
relay.exe
*.exe
*.exe~
*.out
*~
# Linux 编译产物。必须用 / 锚定仓库根：不带斜杠的 relay 会连 cmd/relay/ 源码目录
# 一起匹配，以后往那里新加的文件会被静默忽略。
/relay
/bin/

# Runtime state（restart.sh 写的 pid 文件）
/relay.pid

# Runtime logs
relay.log
relay.err
*.log
/logs/

# Admin SPA build/deps
web/admin/node_modules/
web/admin/dist/

# Local runtime config with secrets (use config.example.yaml as template)
config.yaml
config.local.yaml
config.local*.yaml
config.e2e.yaml
config.aliyun*.yaml

# Test suite result output (dated subdirs: test_res/YYYY-MM-DD/)
test_res/

# Browser-saved pages (often embed third-party secrets / huge asset folders)
docs/*_files/
docs/租赁分*

# Accidental local build/copy artifacts
tmp-*.js
